# Maintain AGENTS.md

This project uses `AGENTS.md` at the repo root as the living project brief for agents.

When you complete work that changes any of the following, update `AGENTS.md` in the same session:

- New or completed features (move items between **Current progress** and **Future roadmap**)
- Dependencies (`package.json`)
- API routes, database schema, or env vars
- Folder structure or architecture

Also bump the **Last updated** date at the top of `AGENTS.md`.

Keep entries concise. Reference file paths instead of pasting large code blocks.
